      "transcript_text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's acute viral bronchitis, and we'll watch how it goes. Antibiotics will not help; fluids, rest and honey are best and the cough can last three weeks. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I'd like you back if not better in three weeks.",
